# Serpent of the Pass, {5}{U}{U}: "This spell costs {1} less to cast for each noncreature, nonland card in your graveyard." Bot1's graveyard on turn 3
# holds Faithless Looting, Entomb and Accumulate Wisdom (three: it costs {2}{U}{U}, four mana) beside an Island and an Ornithopter, a land and a creature
# card that do not count; Bot2's graveyard holds a Lightning Bolt, an opponent's card that does not count either. Exactly four taps (Sapphire, Island,
# Jet, Ruby) cast it and leave the pool empty: had the land, the creature or the Bolt counted, the cost would be {U}{U} or {1}{U}{U} and mana would
# be left in the pool; had one fewer counted, four taps would not pay and the cast would not happen. Only one Lesson is there, so there is no flash
# (Bot1 casts it on its own turn).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Faithless Looting
Entomb
Serpent of the Pass
Island
Ornithopter
Island
Accumulate Wisdom
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Island; Ornithopter)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Search(Accumulate Wisdom)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
? Bot1.Graveyard = Entomb; Accumulate Wisdom; Faithless Looting; Ornithopter; Island
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Serpent of the Pass.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Serpent of the Pass.Toughness = 5
Bot1.Graveyard = Entomb; Accumulate Wisdom; Faithless Looting; Ornithopter; Island
